      "id": "claim_a98316e4bbd34313b59aa79c9704cd15",
      "statement": "The principal package-level API is Polars-first: `compute_features` and the dataset, preprocessing, and discovery objects are re-exported from `ml4t.engineer`, while labeling and relationship/store submodules are exposed without flattening all of their members into the root namespace.",
